Thank you Dr. Blinn and Alan Davis

REPLY

The patch is specific to BIND servers.  So, if none of your systems function 
as BIND servers, you don't need the patch.  It won't hurt anything if you do 
apply it (if you are running 5.0A PK3 for the particular patch you cite), but 
it sounds like you personally don't need it. 


