Offtopic, but most of us live in mixed-vendor shops.

I needed to put up serial consoles on Sun Netra's using a DECServer900 (and
ConsoleWorks). I had custom cables made with this pinout to get it to work :

Both ends : RJ45 Plug

SUN     DEC
1 rts   4 cts
2 dtr   8 dsr
3 txd   2 rxd
4 gnd   1,3 gnd
6 rxd   6 txd
7 dsr   7 dtr
8 cts   5 rts




