the other host and not use the LUN number I specified for the first 
host.  You can see this in the "Hosts/LUNs/State" window of the "Virtual 
Disk Active Properties" page - for instance, if at create time I specify 
volume "somevolumename" with an OS Unit ID of 2 and that it should be 
presented to host "host1", then after creation I present it to host 
